            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JEELLIS"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I buy the cheapest beef I can find, pound it out really thin and cut it into strips about 1 1/2\" wide and 8-9\" long. Put the strips into a ziploc with this marinade overnight and put the strips onto wooden skewers soaked in olive oil the next day. Place them on the grill and there has NEVER been enough! These things go like you wouldn't believe!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
